This template enables kiosk mode for epiphany.

To use this template, add the following to your setup line:

    --templates feature/web-kiosk

Set starting URL via variable STARTING_URL in local.conf.
For example:
STARTING_URL = "https://www.windriver.com"

#@TYPE: Wrtemplate
#@NAME: web-kiosk
#@DESCRIPTION: Enable kiosk mode for epiphany
